 current number of cultures. Therefore, we have the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}B}{\\text{d}t}=k(a-B),\n$$\n\nwhere $a$ is the maximum capacity, and $k>0$ is a constant of proportionality.\n\nIn our case, $a=452$ cultures, and $k=\\frac{2}{5}$. Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}B}{\\text{d}t}=\\frac{2}{5}(452-B).\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["933c700c-2f90-5f96-9512-88ab742c3097"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "065744d3-2f5a-5333-b867-6a06c35d388d" :answer/id #uuid "065744d3-2f5a-5333-b867-6a06c35d388d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}C}{\\text{d}t}=1(88-C)" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0f0beb66-0276-51c0-85cb-0583ade2a515" :answer/id #uuid "0f0beb66-0276-51c0-85cb-0583ade2a515" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}C}{\\text{d}t}=\\frac{88}{3}-C" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ba2c7686-5b5d-54ba-8c3f-bea8a50d531f" :answer/id #uuid "ba2c7686-5b5d-54ba-8c3f-bea8a50d531f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}C}{\\text{d}t}=\\frac{1}{3}(33-C)" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "c99b67f5-dc3f-5e65-bc71-30e0b48c9bc0" :answer/id #uuid "c99b67f5-dc3f-5e65-bc71-30e0b48c9bc0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}C}{\\text{d}t}=\\frac{1}{3}(88-C)" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "c6661b18-4df7-5642-81c2-994f9a50f3fa" :answer/id #uuid "c6661b18-4df7-5642-81c2-994f9a50f3fa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}C}{\\text{d}t}=3(88-C)" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0af52cd0-6e16-5542-83a5-fea287479100" :answer-field/id #uuid "0af52cd0-6e16-5542-83a5-fea287479100" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["065744d3-2f5a-5333-b867-6a06c35d388d" "0f0beb66-0276-51c0-85cb-0583ade2a515" "ba2c7686-5b5d-54ba-8c3f-bea8a50d531f" "c99b67f5-dc3f-5e65-bc71-30e0b48c9bc0" "c6661b18-4df7-5642-81c2-994f9a50f3fa"